amed a Best Regional University North by U.S. News & World Report , and celebrated by Kiplinger’s , Money Magazine , Colleges of Distinction, and Victory Media’s Military Friendly rankings. At Ramapo, students don’t just earn degrees; they discover their strengths, explore new possibilities, and build the foundation for bold futures. Working at Ramapo Ramapo College of New Jersey has been recognized as a “Great College to Work For,” where our employees are at the heart of everything we do. We foster an equitable and fair workplace where ideas are welcomed, contributions are valued, and individuals are encouraged to grow both professionally and personally. Employees benefit from meaningful work, opportunities for development, and the chance to make a lasting impact on students’ lives every day. At Ramapo College, we believe excellence is achieved through teamwork, respect, accountability, innovation, and a shared commitment to learning. Our all-hands-on deck culture requires leadership at all levels to ensure we achieve our mission, implement our goals, and invest in our future one student at a time. We are proud to offer a supportive environment that values well-being and continuous improvement. We believe in being bold, being kind, and being good teammates, making Ramapo not just a place to work, but a great place to belong. Ramapo College offers outstanding benefits through the New Jersey State Benefits system, generous PTO, professional development opportunities, wellness programs, tuition discounts for employees and their dependents, and much more. The Anisfield School of Business has been AACSB-accredited since 2010 and offers seven undergraduate majors: B.S. in Accounting, B.S.in Finance, B.S. in Marketing, B.S. in Management, B.A. in Economics, B.S.in Information Technology Management, and B.A. in International Business. The school offers two graduate programs: M.B.A. and M.S. in Accounting. Compensation: AFT - 10 months - Tenure Track $100,000-$120,000 Ramapo College of New Jersey is committed to considering qualified candidates who are legally authorized to work in the United States. Candidates who are currently authorized to work in the United States through a valid immigration status or employment authorization are encouraged to apply. Visa sponsorship may be considered for qualified candidates and positions, subject to applicable federal immigration laws and regulations. JOB SUMMARY: The Anisfield School of Business at Ramapo College of New Jersey is seeking a tenure-track Assistant Professor of Management to start August 25, 2027. Examples of Duties Duties/Responsibilities: Candidates must have a strong commitment to effective teaching and a demonstrated ability to publish in peer reviewed journals. The successful candidate will be able to teach BADM 495 Strategic Management; other potential courses include MGMT 302 Managing Organizational Behavior and other Management electives . Ability to publish discipline-relevant research in peer-reviewed journals; faculty members are expected to maintain academic qualifications consistent with AACSB standards for scholarship and intellectual contributions. Participate in service, college governance, and student advisement. Perform other duties as assigned. Qualifications Education/Experience: Requirements : Candidates for the position should have a Ph.D. in Management or related area). ABD with imminent completion date will be considered. Ramapo offers a comprehensive benefits package through the State of New Jersey to full-time employees including health care, dental, prescription drug plans, retirement, pension, deferred compensation plans, flexible spending accounts, life insurance, holidays, vacation, and sick leave. To learn more details, visit our benefits page. 01 Do you have a Ph.D. in Management or a related area) or are ABD with imminent completion? yes no 02 Will you require work visa sponsorship by Ramapo College of New Jersey if you are hired? yes no Required Question Employer Ramapo College of New Jersey Address 505 Ramapo Valley Road Mahwah, New Jersey, 07430 Phone 2016847782 Website https://www.schooljobs.com/careers/ramapo? Apply"
